40w, /assets/blog/why-we-built-shared-booth-960.avif?v=845b1c81 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/why-we-built-shared-booth-480.webp?v=5d7eb1d7 480w, /assets/blog/why-we-built-shared-booth-640.webp?v=f7614137 640w, /assets/blog/why-we-built-shared-booth-960.webp?v=bc85cd3c 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/why-we-built-shared-booth-960.webp?v=bc85cd3c\" alt=\"Why We Built Shared Booth\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>Why We Built Shared Booth</h3><p>Distance shouldn't stop people from making memories together. Why we built a shared booth for long-distance friends and couples.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/virtual-date-ideas\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"long-distance\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/virtual-date-ideas-480.avif?v=f5c4ee9d 480w, /assets/blog/virtual-date-ideas-640.avif?v=d438786f 640w, /assets/blog/virtual-date-ideas-960.avif?v=8c6514c0 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/virtual-date-ideas-480.webp?v=33e3ae89 480w, /assets/blog/virtual-date-ideas-640.webp?v=183fc2a7 640w, /assets/blog/virtual-date-ideas-960.webp?v=0777a510 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/virtual-date-ideas-960.webp?v=0777a510\" alt=\"25 Virtual Date Ideas That Are Actually Fun\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>25 Virtual Date Ideas That Are Actually Fun (2026)</h3><p>Movie nights are great, but after the tenth one they start feeling the same. Here are 25 creative virtual date ideas.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/virtual-team-building-photo-ideas\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"long-distance\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/virtual-team-building-photo-ideas-480.avif?v=2e10fea4 480w, /assets/blog/virtual-team-building-photo-ideas-640.avif?v=a2f1c1dc 640w, /assets/blog/virtual-team-building-photo-ideas-960.avif?v=240d4628 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/virtual-team-building-photo-ideas-480.webp?v=ff3e822f 480w, /assets/blog/virtual-team-building-photo-ideas-640.webp?v=6f6463d9 640w, /assets/blog/virtual-team-building-photo-ideas-960.webp?v=25af6c8c 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/virtual-team-building-photo-ideas-960.webp?v=25af6c8c\" alt=\"Illustration of a distributed team on a video call\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>16 Virtual Team Building Ideas That Are Not Forced Fun</h3><p>Built around what remote work actually removes - plus the consent, camera and time-zone problems most team-building advice ignores.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/virtual-birthday-party-ideas\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"long-distance\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/virtual-birthday-party-ideas-480.avif?v=155d38f3 480w, /assets/blog/virtual-birthday-party-ideas-640.avif?v=ecf724be 640w, /assets/blog/virtual-birthday-party-ideas-960.avif?v=6125afe6 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/virtual-birthday-party-ideas-480.webp?v=4ee7e0c4 480w, /assets/blog/virtual-birthday-party-ideas-640.webp?v=44aa42e1 640w, /assets/blog/virtual-birthday-party-ideas-960.webp?v=396262ac 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/virtual-birthday-party-ideas-960.webp?v=396262ac\" alt=\"Illustration of a virtual birthday party on a video call grid\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>Virtual Birthday Party Ideas That Work</h3><p>A tested 75-minute running order, 14 activities, and advice for every group size from four people to forty.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/how-to-stay-close-with-long-distance-friends\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"long-distance\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/how-to-stay-close-with-long-distance-friends-480.avif?v=9ef9d91b 480w, /assets/blog/how-to-stay-close-with-long-distance-friends-640.avif?v=5d058b79 640w, /assets/blog/how-to-stay-close-with-long-distance-friends-960.avif?v=eff59b9a 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/how-to-stay-close-with-long-distance-friends-480.webp?v=741277f3 480w, /assets/blog/how-to-stay-close-with-long-distance-friends-640.webp?v=da9b810d 640w, /assets/blog/how-to-stay-close-with-long-distance-friends-960.webp?v=cd6ab664 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/how-to-stay-close-with-long-distance-friends-960.webp?v=cd6ab664\" alt=\"Illustration of friends connected across different cities\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>How to Stay Close With Long-Distance Friends</h3><p>18 ideas for a relationship nobody schedules - plus how to restart a friendship that has already gone quiet.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/long-distance-relationship-activities\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"long-distance\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/long-distance-relationship-activities-480.avif?v=d47dee2b 480w, /assets/blog/long-distance-relationship-activities-640.avif?v=e9cab712 640w, /assets/blog/long-distance-relationship-activities-960.avif?v=00f3c578 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/long-distance-relationship-activities-480.webp?v=81ade8a6 480w, /assets/blog/long-distance-relationship-activities-640.webp?v=ea2d9056 640w, /assets/blog/long-distance-relationship-activities-960.webp?v=42bd0258 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/long-distance-relationship-activities-960.webp?v=42bd0258\" alt=\"Illustration of a couple connected across two cities\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>20 Long-Distance Relationship Activities</h3><p>Sorted by time needed - five-minute habits, evening activities and rituals that build over months. Plus what distance actually takes away.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a></div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"blog-hub-more\" aria-labelledby=\"more-topics\"><h2 id=\"more-topics\" class=\"blog-hub-more-title\">Browse by topic</h2><ul class=\"blog-hub-more-list\"><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/tag/photo-strips\">Photo Strips</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/tag/couples\">Couples</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/tag/friends\">Friends</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/tag/long-distance\">Long Distance</a></li><li><a class=\"b